OL,3,GFEATURES CThe introduction of colour on
OL,4,CBBC One and ITV
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is easy to say when each ITV company
OL,7,Fswitched to colour. These were big
OL,8,Fevents for the company locally and
OL,9,Foften accompanied by huge promotional
OL,10,Factivity.
OL,12,FThe big 5 ` Thames, LWT, ATV, Yorkshire
OL,13,Fand Granada ` all switched to colour in
OL,14,FNovember 1969.
OL,16,FIt was not certain until a late stage
OL,17,Fthat the Emley Moore transmitter
OL,18,Fserving Yorkshire ` then a temporary
OL,19,Fstructure after the collapse of the
OL,20,Fmain mast a few months earlier ` would
OL,21,Fbe ready for the 15th.
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12104
SC,0004
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F121A1768742397
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G4/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CThe introduction of colour on
OL,4,CBBC One and ITV
OL,5,
OL,6,FTV Times had a special colour cover in
OL,7,FLondon, the Midlands and the North West
OL,8,Fbut not Yorkshire.
OL,10,FThe other ITV companies across Great
OL,11,FBritain and Northern Ireland gradually
OL,12,Fswitched to colour transmission over
OL,13,Fthe next two years with great local
OL,14,Ffanfare.
OL,16,FIt should be remembered that the order
OL,17,Fhad nothing to do with the local
OL,18,Fcompanies ` it was about the extension
OL,19,Fof the UHF transmitter network by the
OL,20,FBBC and ITA.
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12105
SC,0005
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F121A1768742397
