OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CThe introduction of colour on
OL,4,CBBC One and ITV
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut, in general, the large and
OL,7,Fmedium-sized companies were also able
OL,8,Fto produce a large proportion of their
OL,9,Flocal output in colour at the point of
OL,10,Fswitchover.
OL,12,FSTV ` recovering from a fire which
OL,13,Fdevastated their main Glasgow studio `
OL,14,Fstill had a colour OB unit and a colour
OL,15,Fstudio in Edinburgh.
OL,17,FSouthern moved to a new studio complex
OL,18,Fwhich was ready for colour.
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
