OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F121A1768742397
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G6/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CThe introduction of colour on
OL,4,CBBC One and ITV
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut some small companies like Border
OL,7,Fand Grampian had very limited colour
OL,8,Ffacilities to begin with.
OL,10,FMy understanding is that all Border's
OL,11,Fprogrammes remained in black and white.
OL,12,FBut it was able to show network
OL,13,Fprogrammes, programmes played out from
OL,14,Ffilm and adverts in colour from 1971.
OL,15,FBut it had no colour production or
OL,16,Fcolour VT facilities of its own to
OL,17,Fbegin with.
OL,19,FGrampian may have been in a similar
OL,20,Fsituation.
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
