OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CThe introduction of colour on
OL,4,CBBC One and ITV
OL,5,
OL,6,FTest Card F was used for network trade
OL,7,Ftest transmissions on BBC One.
OL,9,FThe spread of the corporation's main
OL,10,Fservice in colour did lead to
OL,11,Fpromotional activity in the areas
OL,12,Fserved. But there was no promotion to
OL,13,Fsuggest that, say, BBC South or BBC
OL,14,FScotland itself was switching to colour
OL,15,Fstraight away.
OL,17,FGenerally speaking, only the network
OL,18,Foutput was in colour to begin with.
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
