OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CThe introduction of colour on
OL,4,CBBC One and ITV
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresumably though the regions had
OL,7,Fequipment to allow a smooth opt from
OL,8,Fnetwork colour to local monochrome ` it
OL,9,Fwould have looked horrendous had the
OL,10,Foutput suddenly switched to black and
OL,11,Fwhite when the region went into circuit
OL,12,F30 seconds or so earlier.
OL,14,FThe nations and regions gradually
OL,15,Fproduced more of their opt out and
OL,16,Fnetwork programmes in colour.
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
