OL,3,GFEATURES CThe introduction of colour on
OL,4,CBBC One and ITV
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile it may sound strange now to talk
OL,7,Fabout black and white regional output
OL,8,Fin the 1970s, it should be remembered
OL,9,Fthat a colour TV was an expensive
OL,10,Finvestment for viewers.
OL,12,FColour TV sales and rentals only
OL,13,Fstarted to take off around 1973.
OL,15,FBy then, viewers in all major
OL,16,Fpopulation centres and all TV regions
OL,17,F(other than Channel) had access to
OL,18,Fthree channels in colour. Sets were
OL,19,Ffalling in cost and improving in
OL,20,Fsophistication.
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12113
SC,0013
CT,3,C
PS,c008
