OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CThe introduction of colour on
OL,4,CBBC One and ITV
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ridiculous negative stories about
OL,7,Fcolour TV ` from horrendous hues on
OL,8,Fbadly adjusted sets being seen as the
OL,9,Fnorm, to fire hazards ` were being
OL,10,Fdisproved every time someone saw a
OL,11,Fproperly adjusted set in a showroom or
OL,12,Fa friend's house.
OL,14,FColour TV's spread across the ITV
OL,15,Fnetwork was a process.
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
