OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CThe introduction of colour on
OL,4,CBBC One and ITV
OL,5,
OL,6,FUltimately on our beloved BBC One (I
OL,7,Fuse the term deliberately after the
OL,8,Fpast week at the corporation) the
OL,9,Flaunch of colour was a national event `
OL,10,Feven if some of the country couldn't
OL,11,Fjoin the party for some time.
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
